+    1079                    "Knows how to pierce through the thickest of armor. Effective with sharps when fighting Undead. Additional shield attacks increase his damage."
+    1080                    "Purely defensive type of gladiator. Tough, powerful, unbreakable. Knows how to wear out the opponent before finishing them off."
